  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - Reason for Refusal\r\n\r\nThe proposed rear extension would add significantly to the rear of the existing dwelling and would be well in excess of the recommended depth of Council's residential extension guidelines, to the detriment of the character and the appearance of the original dwelling.  It would appear visually intrusive when viewed from neighbouring premises and would detract from the open aspect to the rear of the dwelling at 265 Uxbridge Road.  It is considered to be an over development of the property and is therefore contrary to Adopted UDP policies ENV-B.1.1 (New Development) H.4.1 (Housing standards and Guidelines) and H.6.4 (Extensions and Alterations) of The London Borough of Hounslow UDP, Adopted December 2003 and supplementary planning guidelines.  \r\n"
